ItemDisplay[WEAPON !STAFF !WAND !SOR !(DAGGER !THROWING) (MAG OR RARE OR CRAFT) CLVL>79 ED~300-399 !EQUIPPED]:%NAME%{%ORANGE%**%YELLOW%**   %ORANGE%+%ED%% Enhanced Damage   %YELLOW%**%ORANGE%**%CL%%NAME%}%CONTINUE%//
ItemDisplay[WEAPON !STAFF !WAND !SOR !(DAGGER !THROWING) (MAG OR RARE OR CRAFT) CLVL>79 ED~300-399 EQUIPPED]:%NAME%{%ORANGE%**%YELLOW%**   %ORANGE%+%EDAM%% Enhanced Damage   %YELLOW%**%ORANGE%**%CL%%NAME%}%CONTINUE%//

