ItemDisplay[(MAG OR CRAFT OR RARE) WEAPON !STAFF !WAND !SOR ((SUFFIX=907 CLVL<60) OR SUFFIX=908 OR SUFFIX=909) CLVL>59 ED<300]:%NAME%{%PURPLE%Lower Resist%CL%%NAME%}%CONTINUE%//

